    {
      "title": "Latency and Cost Metrics",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Latency and Cost Metrics",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Latency and Throughput",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Send",
                    "sub": "prompt",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "TTFT",
                    "sub": "first token",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "x",
                    "text": "Stream",
                    "sub": "per-token time",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Done",
                    "sub": "total latency",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==TTFT== = time to first token; drives **perceived speed**",
                "==Inter-token latency== = gap between streamed tokens",
                "Total latency = ==TTFT + tokens × per-token time==",
                "==Throughput== = tokens/sec or requests/sec",
                "Track ==p50== and **p95/p99**, not just the average"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Cost",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Cost = ==input tokens × input price== + ==output tokens × output price==",
                "Output tokens usually cost **several times** more than input"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Levers and Mistakes",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Lever",
                "Use it for"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Smaller model",
                  "easy tasks"
                ],
                [
                  "Prompt caching",
                  "repeated prefixes"
                ],
                [
                  "Shorter prompts",
                  "fewer input tokens"
                ],
                [
                  "`max_tokens` cap",
                  "bounds output cost"
                ],
                [
                  "Batching",
                  "offline jobs"
                ],
                [
                  "Streaming",
                  "UX, faster first feedback"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Cost per successful task",
              "text": "Average cost per call hides waste. ==Retries==, long contexts and agent loops multiply spend."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Safety Basics",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Safety Basics",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Prompt Injection",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Prompt injection==: untrusted text carries instructions that hijack the model",
                "Carriers: a web page, an email, a document",
                "==Indirect injection== is the common real-world form"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Layered Defenses",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Separate",
                    "sub": "trusted vs untrusted",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Least privilege",
                    "sub": "minimal tools",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Confirm",
                    "sub": "destructive actions",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Sandbox",
                    "sub": "execution",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Guardrails",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Stage",
                "Checks"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Input",
                  "moderation or classifier filter, ==PII redaction=="
                ],
                [
                  "Output",
                  "==schema validation==, refusal handling"
                ],
                [
                  "Before shell, SQL, HTML",
                  "treat output as **untrusted** (injection risk)"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Mistakes",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Secrets in prompts: never put keys or tokens there",
                "Model output passed raw to a shell, SQL or HTML"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Not a defense alone",
              "text": "A system-prompt line 'ignore malicious instructions' is not enough. Add ==red-teaming== and **log flagged cases**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
